{"word":"γελοῖος","uri":"geloios","senses":[{"word":"γελοῖος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">γελοῖος,</span></span> <span class=\"ital\">ou att.</span>\n<span class=\"es\">γέλοιος,</span> <span class=\"des\">α, ον,</span>\nqui fait rire, <span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> risible, plaisant,\n<span class=\"ital\">p. opp. à</span> <span class=\"grec\">σπουδαῖος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Cyr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 3, 1 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Isocr.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">8</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span> ; <span class=\"ital\">différ. de</span> <span class=\"grec\">καταγέλαστος</span> : <span class=\"grec\">γελοῖα εἰπεῖν\nἀλλὰ μὴ καταγέλαστα,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Conv.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">189</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>, dire des choses\nrisibles, mais non ridicules ; <span class=\"grec\">Αἰσώπου τι\nγέλοιον,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Vesp.</span> <span class=\"refch\">566,</span> <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> <span class=\"grec\">Αἰσωπικὸν γέλοιον,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">ibid.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1259,</span>\nqqe récit plaisant d’Ésope <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> à la façon\nd’Ésope ; <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de pers.</span> plaisant,\nbouffon, <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> (<span class=\"aut\">Ath.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">613</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span>) ; <span class=\"aut\">Lgn</span> <span class=\"refch\">34</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> ridicule, <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 215</span> (<span class=\"ital\">épq.</span> <span class=\"grec\">γελοίϊος</span>) ;\n<span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">8, 25 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">γέλοιος ἔσομαι αὐτοσχεδιάζων,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Phæ